<h2>Common submission standard</h2><p>Include equations and assumptions, code, a YAML configuration, a locked environment, numerical results with units, and a failure analysis. Cite external ideas and respect source licenses. Disclose assistance and keep responsibility for verifying all submitted claims.</p>
<p>The weekly reference practices are formative material. Assessment requires the additional experiments and analysis specified in each brief. This draft has no announced dates or institution-specific late-work policy.</p>
